WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.546 line:8%
From Students, choose New application.

00:00:02.546 --> 00:00:08.658 line:8%
Select the intake and enter the applicant's name, NIC and contact details.

00:00:09.670 --> 00:00:13.091 line:8%
Create the application, then choose Decide application.

00:00:13.091 --> 00:00:18.468 line:8%
Select Accepted after checking that the intake fee plan is correct.

00:00:19.477 --> 00:00:23.039 line:8%
Confirm the decision and open the new enrolment.

00:00:23.039 --> 00:00:30.164 line:8%
Acceptance creates the student and enrolment; an existing NIC needs explicit confirmation to reuse that person.
